.navbar-brand {
    position: absolute;
    /*width: 100%;*/
    left: 50%;
    top: 0;
    text-align: center;
    margin: auto;
}

and add this css also:
@media (max-width:767px){
    a.navbar-brand {
        left: 45%;
  }
}

